                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32f102f3-6a38-3424-ae2c-35dd56bd6b37",
                        "entry_id": "dd8447f3-cb73-3052-a4b7-11b65e468510",
                        "glosses": [
                            "superlative degree of дре́вний (drévnij)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "form-of",
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1d8abf5-e9c4-4c64-b9c0-1aef592f8c0c",
                                "sense_id": "32f102f3-6a38-3424-ae2c-35dd56bd6b37",
                                "text": "— Не завирайся, — нахмурилась Хлоя. — Как можно придумать целый народ? Древнейший народ?\n— Придумали не ваши тела, — ответил дискурсмонгер, — а вашу культуру и историю. В том числе и ваше представление о том, что вы древнейший народ.",
                                "translation": "‘Don’t tell lies,’ Chloe said with a frown. ‘How can you invent an entire nation? A most ancient nation?’\n‘They didn’t invent your bodies,’ the discoursemonger replied, ‘but your culture and history. Including your idea about being a most ancient nation.’",
                                "english": "‘Don’t tell lies,’ Chloe said with a frown. ‘How can you invent an entire nation? A most ancient nation?’\n‘They didn’t invent your bodies,’ the discoursemonger replied, ‘but your culture and history. Including your idea about being a most ancient nation.’"
                            }
                        ]
